# user_stories

1 - As a user, I want to be able to add new vocabulary words so that I can build a personalized list of terms I will be studying

2 - As a user, I want to view all vocabulary I've added so that I can see what I have to learn

3 - As a user, I want to be able to edit vocabulary entries so that I can correct mistakes 

4 - As a user, I want to be able to delete vocabulary so that I can remove words I no longer need to memorize

5 - As a user, I want to be able to search for words by character or english meaning so that I can find vocabulary quickly

6 - As a user, I want to be able to mark words as "known", "learning", or "please review", so I can track my progress

7 - As a user, I want to view the different forms of characters, so I can learn all aspects of the word

8 - As a user, I want to see how many words I have completed so far, so I can see how far I have come in learning